Vulpes bounded into the inky abyss. His brilliance roused the slumbering Elder Gods, who unleashed their shadowy hounds to hunt the glowing thief. As Vulpes sprinted across the black expanse, dark jaws snapped at his heels.

Desperate to blind his pursuers, Vulpes crushed the Spindle, exhaling its fiery stardust into the frigid cosmic winds. The silver strands wove constellations, while the shattered embers erupted into ribbons of emerald, sapphire, and violet. Forever chased, Vulpes runs on, his radiant breath casting the eternal aurora that guides lost wolves home.

